	('How about a plaster on it?','Hay dán một miếng băng lên nhé?','00:03:14.760','00:03:16.460','peppa-pig-3'),
	('Open wide, please','Mở miệng to ra nào','00:03:18.100','00:03:19.800','peppa-pig-3'),
	('Suzy takes George\'s temperature','Cừu Suzy đo nhiệt độ cho Heo George','00:03:21.280','00:03:22.760','peppa-pig-3'),
	('Oh, dear','Ôi trời','00:03:23.980','00:03:24.840','peppa-pig-3'),
